#ASSERT `Under section 25.1, am I, a public officer, justified, subject to subsections (9), (11) and (14)` `a person in a capacity that is none of those` `a person in a capacity that is none of those` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE `s 25.1(9)(b) none of those things` `s 25.1(11) other conduct` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- whether the person is a public officer is not answered by the text: not covered

