#ASSERT `Under section 25.4(1), is the senior official required to notify me in writing` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- as in the layer-1 test: an act under 25.1(9)(a) or (b), a report filed, property lost or seriously damaged
