#ASSERT `Under section 28(1), am I protected from criminal responsibility for arresting the person who is not the person named in the warrant` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- as in the layer-1 test: authorized, in good faith and on reasonable grounds
#ASSERT `Under section 28(1), am I protected from criminal responsibility for arresting the person who is not the person named in the warrant` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- as in the layer-1 test: not authorized to execute a warrant to arrest
