-- Under section 28(2), am I protected from criminal responsibility to the same extent as if the person arrested were the person named in the warrant?
#ASSERT `Under section 28(2), am I protected from criminal responsibility to the same extent as if the person arrested were the person named in the warrant` TRUE `s 28(2)(a) a person who, being called on to assist the person authorized to execute the warrant, is called on to assist in an arrest` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- as in the layer-1 test: (a): called on to assist, believing it is the person named
#ASSERT `Under section 28(2), am I protected from criminal responsibility to the same extent as if the person arrested were the person named in the warrant` TRUE `s 28(2)(b) a keeper of a prison who is required to receive and detain a person` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- as in the layer-1 test: (b): a keeper who believes the person was arrested under the warrant
