#ASSERT `Under section 28(2), am I protected from criminal responsibility to the same extent as if the person arrested were the person named in the warrant` TRUE `s 28(2)(b) a keeper of a prison who is required to receive and detain a person` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- as in the layer-1 test: (b) without that belief
#ASSERT `Under section 28(2), am I protected from criminal responsibility to the same extent as if the person arrested were the person named in the warrant` FALSE `s 28(2)(a) a person who, being called on to assist the person authorized to execute the warrant, is called on to assist in an arrest` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- as in the layer-1 test: "Where a person is authorized to execute a warrant to arrest" is not met
#ASSERT `Under section 28(2), am I protected from criminal responsibility to the same extent as if the person arrested were the person named in the warrant` FALSE `s 28(2)(b) a keeper of a prison who is required to receive and detain a person` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- as in the layer-1 test: same

