#ASSERT `Under section 30, may I detain the person who commits or is about to join in or to renew the breach of the peace` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- as in the layer-1 test: witnesses; the detainee commits or is about to join or renew; to give into custody; no more force than reasonably necessary
#ASSERT `Under section 30, may I detain the person who commits or is about to join in or to renew the breach of the peace` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- as in the layer-1 test: does not witness
#ASSERT `Under section 30, may I detain the person who commits or is about to join in or to renew the breach of the peace` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- as in the layer-1 test: the detainee does not commit, join or renew

