#ASSERT `Under section 31(1), am I justified in arresting the person` `s 31(1) a peace officer who witnesses a breach of the peace` `a mayor` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- as in the layer-1 test: a peace officer who on reasonable grounds believes the person is about to join or renew it
#ASSERT `Under section 31(1), am I justified in arresting the person` `s 31(1) a peace officer who witnesses a breach of the peace` `a mayor` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- as in the layer-1 test: neither ground
#ASSERT `Under section 31(1), am I justified in arresting the person` `s 31(1) a peace officer who witnesses a breach of the peace` `a person in a capacity that is none of those` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- as in the layer-1 test: section 2 did not answer

-- Under section 31(2), am I, a peace officer, justified in receiving the person into custody?
