#ASSERT `Under section 31(2), am I, a peace officer, justified in receiving the person into custody` `a mayor` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- as in the layer-1 test: given into charge by one the peace officer on reasonable grounds believes has witnessed it
