#ASSERT `Under section 33(1), do I have the duty to disperse or to arrest persons who do not comply with the proclamation` TRUE `a person in a capacity that is none of those` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- as in the layer-1 test: assisting: section 2 does not matter
