#ASSERT `Under section 81(1), have I committed an offence by using explosives` `s 81(1)(c) with intent to destroy or damage property without lawful excuse, places or throws an explosive substance anywhere` TRUE FALSE `anything intended to be used to make an explosive substance` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- paragraph (c)
#ASSERT `Under section 81(1), have I committed an offence by using explosives` `s 81(1)(c) with intent to destroy or damage property without lawful excuse, places or throws an explosive substance anywhere` TRUE FALSE `anything intended to be used to make an explosive substance` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- with lawful excuse
#ASSERT `Under section 81(2), what is the most imprisonment I face for using explosives` `s 81(1)(a) does anything with intent to cause an explosion of an explosive substance that is likely to cause serious bodily harm or death to persons or is likely to cause serious damage to property` EQUALS JUST `imprisonment for life`   -- (2)(a): paragraph (1)(a)
#ASSERT `Under section 81(2), what is the most imprisonment I face for using explosives` `s 81(1)(c) with intent to destroy or damage property without lawful excuse, places or throws an explosive substance anywhere` EQUALS JUST (`imprisonment for a term of` `fourteen years`)   -- (2)(b): paragraph (1)(c)
#ASSERT `Under section 81(2), what is the most imprisonment I face for using explosives` `s 81(1) an act that is none of those in paragraphs (a) to (d)` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Under section 81(2), what class of offence is using explosives` EQUALS `an indictable offence`
