#ASSERT `Under section 82.1, must a sentence for possessing an explosive for a criminal organization be served consecutively to my other punishment or sentence` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- another offence

§ `Cases -- Nuclear material, radioactive material and devices: sections 82.2 to 82.7 (lines 1219-1233)`
#ASSERT `Under section 82.2, is the thing a device for the purposes of sections 82.3 to 82.5` `s 82.2(a) a nuclear explosive device` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- a nuclear explosive device
