#ASSERT `Under section 82.3, have I committed the offence of dealing with nuclear material, radioactive material or a device, or of acting against a nuclear facility, with intent to cause death, serious bodily harm or substantial damage` `s 82.3 possesses, uses, transfers, exports, imports, alters or disposes of nuclear material` TRUE `plutonium` 0 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE `a thing that is neither of those` `s 82.2 a device of none of those kinds` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was #ASSERT `Under section 82.3, have I committed the offence of dealing with nuclear material, radioactive material or a device with intent to cause death, harm or damage` `s 82.3 possesses, uses, transfers, exports, imports, alters or disposes of nuclear material` TRUE `plutonium` 0 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE `a thing that is neither of those` `s 82.2 a device of none of those kinds` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE; retitled: the body also answers acts against a nuclear facility and acts that cause serious interference with its operations; answer unchanged (possessing plutonium with intent)
#ASSERT `Under section 82.3, have I committed the offence of dealing with nuclear material, radioactive material or a device, or of acting against a nuclear facility, with intent to cause death, serious bodily harm or substantial damage` `s 82.3 possesses, uses, transfers, exports, imports, alters or disposes of nuclear material` TRUE `uranium with an isotopic concentration equal to that occurring in nature` 0 0 TRUE FALSE FALSE `a thing that is neither of those` `s 82.2 a device of none of those kinds` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was #ASSERT `Under section 82.3, have I committed the offence of dealing with nuclear material, radioactive material or a device with intent to cause death, harm or damage` `s 82.3 possesses, uses, transfers, exports, imports, alters or disposes of nuclear material` TRUE `uranium with an isotopic concentration equal to that occurring in nature` 0 0 TRUE FALSE FALSE `a thing that is neither of those` `s 82.2 a device of none of those kinds` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE; retitled: the body also answers acts against a nuclear facility and acts that cause serious interference with its operations; answer unchanged (natural uranium in the form of ore is not nuclear material: s 2)
#ASSERT `Under section 82.3, have I committed the offence of dealing with nuclear material, radioactive material or a device, or of acting against a nuclear facility, with intent to cause death, serious bodily harm or substantial damage` `s 82.3 commits an act against a nuclear facility` TRUE `a substance that is none of those` 0 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE `a nuclear reactor, including a reactor installed on a vessel, vehicle, aircraft or space object for use as an energy source in order to propel the vessel, vehicle, aircraft or space object or for any other purpose` `s 82.2 a device of none of those kinds` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was #ASSERT `Under section 82.3, have I committed the offence of dealing with nuclear material, radioactive material or a device with intent to cause death, harm or damage` `s 82.3 commits an act against a nuclear facility` TRUE `a substance that is none of those` 0 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE `a nuclear reactor, including a reactor installed on a vessel, vehicle, aircraft or space object for use as an energy source in order to propel the vessel, vehicle, aircraft or space object or for any other purpose` `s 82.2 a device of none of those kinds` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE; retitled: the body also answers acts against a nuclear facility and acts that cause serious interference with its operations; answer unchanged (an act against a nuclear reactor)
#ASSERT `Under section 82.3, have I committed the offence of dealing with nuclear material, radioactive material or a device, or of acting against a nuclear facility, with intent to cause death, serious bodily harm or substantial damage` `s 82.3 makes a device` TRUE `a substance that is none of those` 0 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE `a thing that is neither of those` `s 82.2(a) a nuclear explosive device` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was #ASSERT `Under section 82.3, have I committed the offence of dealing with nuclear material, radioactive material or a device with intent to cause death, harm or damage` `s 82.3 makes a device` TRUE `a substance that is none of those` 0 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE `a thing that is neither of those` `s 82.2(a) a nuclear explosive device` FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE; retitled: the body also answers acts against a nuclear facility and acts that cause serious interference with its operations; answer unchanged (making a nuclear explosive device)
#ASSERT `Under section 82.3, have I committed the offence of dealing with nuclear material, radioactive material or a device, or of acting against a nuclear facility, with intent to cause death, serious bodily harm or substantial damage` `s 82.3 possesses, uses, transfers, exports, imports, alters or disposes of nuclear material` FALSE `plutonium` 0 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE `a thing that is neither of those` `s 82.2 a device of none of those kinds` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was #ASSERT `Under section 82.3, have I committed the offence of dealing with nuclear material, radioactive material or a device with intent to cause death, harm or damage` `s 82.3 possesses, uses, transfers, exports, imports, alters or disposes of nuclear material` FALSE `plutonium` 0 0 FALSE FALSE FALSE `a thing that is neither of those` `s 82.2 a device of none of those kinds` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING; retitled: the body also answers acts against a nuclear facility and acts that cause serious interference with its operations; answer unchanged (no intent)
#ASSERT `Under section 82.3, what penalty does the section state for dealing with nuclear material, radioactive material or a device, or acting against a nuclear facility, with intent to harm` EQUALS `Under sections 46 to 83, what the section states about the penalty` OF `an indictable offence`, `imprisonment for life`, `no imprisonment is stated`, FALSE   -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was #ASSERT `Under section 82.3, what penalty does the section state for dealing with nuclear material, radioactive material or a device with intent to harm` EQUALS `Under sections 46 to 83, what the section states about the penalty` OF `an indictable offence`, `imprisonment for life`, `no imprisonment is stated`, FALSE; retitled: the penalty is for every act the section names, nuclear-facility acts included; answer unchanged
