#ASSERT `Under section 83.1(1)(a), must I tell the Commissioner of the RCMP or the Director of CSIS of the existence of property in my possession or control` FALSE `s 83.01(1) seat yes` TRUE TRUE `s 83.01(1) seat yes` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was `#ASSERT `Under section 83.1(1), must I tell the Commissioner of the RCMP or the Director of CSIS about property I hold` FALSE `s 83.01(1) seat yes` TRUE TRUE `s 83.01(1) seat yes` EQUALS JUST TRUE`; the question is retitled to the limb or section its body answers, the answer is unchanged (a Canadian outside Canada)
#ASSERT `Under section 83.1(1)(a), must I tell the Commissioner of the RCMP or the Director of CSIS of the existence of property in my possession or control` FALSE `s 83.01(1) seat no` TRUE TRUE `s 83.01(1) seat yes` EQUALS NOTHING   -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was `#ASSERT `Under section 83.1(1), must I tell the Commissioner of the RCMP or the Director of CSIS about property I hold` FALSE `s 83.01(1) seat no` TRUE TRUE `s 83.01(1) seat yes` EQUALS NOTHING`; the question is retitled to the limb or section its body answers, the answer is unchanged (outside Canada and not a Canadian)
