#ASSERT `Under section 83.1(1)(a), must I tell the Commissioner of the RCMP or the Director of CSIS of the existence of property in my possession or control` TRUE `s 83.01(1) seat no` TRUE FALSE `s 83.01(1) seat yes` EQUALS NOTHING   -- RECONCILED 2026-11-12: was `#ASSERT `Under section 83.1(1), must I tell the Commissioner of the RCMP or the Director of CSIS about property I hold` TRUE `s 83.01(1) seat no` TRUE FALSE `s 83.01(1) seat yes` EQUALS NOTHING`; the question is retitled to the limb or section its body answers, the answer is unchanged (you do not know that it is owned or controlled by or on behalf of the group)
