#ASSERT `Under section 83.11(2), by what day must my business make its next report, if my last report was on a given day` (Date 31 1 2026) 0 EQUALS (Date 28 2 2026)   -- one month after 31 January falls at the end of February (the month-end clamp)
#ASSERT `Under section 83.11(2), by what day must my business make its next report, if my last report was on a given day` (Date 1 3 2026) 14 EQUALS (Date 15 3 2026)   -- a regulation specifies 14 days
