§ `Proceedings, jurisdiction and aggravated punishment (ss 83.24 to 83.27)`

#ASSERT `Under section 83.24, are proceedings against me barred from being commenced without the Attorney General's consent` `s 83.01(1) seat yes` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- a terrorism offence, no consent of the Attorney General: barred
#ASSERT `Under section 83.24, are proceedings against me barred from being commenced without the Attorney General's consent` `s 83.01(1) seat no` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- an offence under section 83.12, no consent: barred
#ASSERT `Under section 83.24, are proceedings against me barred from being commenced without the Attorney General's consent` `s 83.01(1) seat yes` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- with the consent of the Attorney General the bar says nothing
#ASSERT `Under section 83.24, are proceedings against me barred from being commenced without the Attorney General's consent` `s 83.01(1) seat no` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- neither a terrorism offence nor an offence under 83.12: the bar is limited to those
#ASSERT `Under section 83.24, are proceedings against me barred from being commenced without the Attorney General's consent` `s 83.01(1) seat I do not know` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- whether the offence is a terrorism offence is not settled
