#ASSERT `Under section 83.25(1), may proceedings against me be commenced at the instance of the Government of Canada in any territorial division in Canada` `s 83.01(1) seat no` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- an offence under section 83.12, alleged outside the province
#ASSERT `Under section 83.25(1), may proceedings against me be commenced at the instance of the Government of Canada in any territorial division in Canada` `s 83.01(1) seat yes` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- alleged to have occurred inside the province: the subsection says nothing
#ASSERT `Under section 83.25(1), may proceedings against me be commenced at the instance of the Government of Canada in any territorial division in Canada` `s 83.01(1) seat no` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- not a terrorism offence nor an offence under 83.12: "Where a person is alleged to have committed" is not met
