#ASSERT `Under section 117, is the competent authority bound to order the thing returned to me as its owner, or its proceeds or value paid to me` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- an element is missing: the prohibition order is an order under subsection 109(1) or 110(1) / the person had no reasonable grounds to believe that the thing would or might be used in the commission of the offence in respect of which the prohibition order was made


#ASSERT `Under section 117, what must the competent authority order for me as the owner` TRUE FALSE EQUALS `s 117 the thing is returned to the owner`
#ASSERT `Under section 117, what must the competent authority order for me as the owner` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `s 117 the proceeds of the sale are paid to the owner`
#ASSERT `Under section 117, what must the competent authority order for me as the owner` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 117 an amount equal to the value of the thing is paid to the owner`

