§§ `s 117.01 Possession contrary to order`

#ASSERT `Under section 117.01(4), does section 117.01(1) not apply to me because I possessed a firearm in accordance with an authorization or licence issued as the result of an order under section 113(1)` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the person states every element
#ASSERT `Under section 117.01(4), does section 117.01(1) not apply to me because I possessed a firearm in accordance with an authorization or licence issued as the result of an order under section 113(1)` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- an element is missing: the person possessed a firearm in accordance with an authorization or licence issued to the person as the result of an order made under subsection 113(1)

#ASSERT `Under section 117.01, is possessing a weapon while prohibited by an order, or wilfully failing to surrender an authorization, licence or registration certificate, an offence on what I did` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the person states every element of s 117.01(1)
#ASSERT `Under section 117.01, is possessing a weapon while prohibited by an order, or wilfully failing to surrender an authorization, licence or registration certificate, an offence on what I did` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- the person states every element of s 117.01(2)
#ASSERT `Under section 117.01, is possessing a weapon while prohibited by an order, or wilfully failing to surrender an authorization, licence or registration certificate, an offence on what I did` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- the person states no limb

