#ASSERT `Under section 145(10), may I, with leave of the court, require the person who made the certificate to attend for cross-examination` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING   -- an element is missing: a certificate described in subsection (9) is produced against the accused
#ASSERT `Under section 145(10), may I, with leave of the court, require the person who made the certificate to attend for cross-examination` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- an element is missing: the court gives leave

