#ASSERT `Under section 145(11), is the certificate barred from reception in evidence against me for want of reasonable notice before the trial` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- an element is missing: the certificate is tendered under subsection (9)
#ASSERT `Under section 145(11), is the certificate barred from reception in evidence against me for want of reasonable notice before the trial` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- the exception applies: the party intending to produce it has, before the trial, given the accused reasonable notice of the intention together with a copy of the certificate

