-- the thing is not such evidence: the section says what may be seized, not that nothing else may
#ASSERT `Under section 199(2), may a peace officer seize something I have` (`a police officer, police constable, bailiff, constable, or other person employed for the preservation and maintenance of the public peace or for the service or execution of civil process`) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

