§ `Keeping, being found in, and betting offences (sections 201 to 203)`

-- you keep a place kept or used to play games in which a bank is kept by one but not all of the players: a common gaming house
#ASSERT `Under section 201(1), have I committed the offence of keeping a common gaming house or common betting house` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- you keep a place opened, kept or used so that people can bet among themselves or with the keeper: a common betting house
#ASSERT `Under section 201(1), have I committed the offence of keeping a common gaming house or common betting house` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a common gaming house, but you do not keep it: this section does not reach you (it may be section 201(2))
#ASSERT `Under section 201(1), have I committed the offence of keeping a common gaming house or common betting house` FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- you keep a place that is neither: the text does not make it an offence
#ASSERT `Under section 201(1), have I committed the offence of keeping a common gaming house or common betting house` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- 201(1): guilty of an indictable offence and liable to imprisonment for a term not exceeding two years, or an offence punishable on summary conviction
#ASSERT `Under section 201(1), how serious is the offence of keeping a common gaming house or common betting house, and what can it cost me` EQUALS `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty` OF `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`, (LIST (Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 2, 0, 0, FALSE), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`)), TRUE

-- found in a common gaming house with no lawful excuse: 201(2)(a)
#ASSERT `Under section 201(2), have I committed the offence of being found in, or letting the use of, a gaming or betting house` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- found in it but with lawful excuse: the offence is "without lawful excuse"; the text does not say what else applies
#ASSERT `Under section 201(2), have I committed the offence of being found in, or letting the use of, a gaming or betting house` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- the owner who knowingly permits the place to be used as a common gaming house: 201(2)(b)
#ASSERT `Under section 201(2), have I committed the offence of being found in, or letting the use of, a gaming or betting house` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- the owner did not knowingly permit it
#ASSERT `Under section 201(2), have I committed the offence of being found in, or letting the use of, a gaming or betting house` FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- found in a place that is neither a common gaming house nor a common betting house: not covered
#ASSERT `Under section 201(2), have I committed the offence of being found in, or letting the use of, a gaming or betting house` TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- 201(2): guilty of an offence punishable on summary conviction; the section states no penalty of its own, so section 787(1) supplies it
#ASSERT `Under section 201(2), how serious is the offence of being found in, or letting the use of, a gaming or betting house, and what can it cost me` EQUALS `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty` OF `an offence punishable on summary conviction`, EMPTY, TRUE

-- 202(1)(d): records or registers bets or sells a pool
