-- the good-faith periodical exception is limited to paragraph (g)
#ASSERT `Under section 202(1), have I committed one of the offences of betting, book-making or pool-selling` `s 202(1)(d) records or registers bets or sells a pool` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE

