-- (c) for each subsequent offence, not more than two years and not less than three months
#ASSERT `Under section 202(2), how serious is each offence under section 202, and what can it cost me` 2 EQUALS `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty` OF `an indictable offence`, (LIST (Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 2, 0, 0, FALSE), `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 3, 0, FALSE), `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`)), FALSE

