#ASSERT `Under section 206(1), how serious is an offence under section 206(1), and what can it cost me` EQUALS `Under sections 197 to 269.1, the gravity and the penalty` OF `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`, (LIST (Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 2, 0, 0, FALSE), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`)), TRUE

