-- no death caused
#ASSERT `Under section 222(5), have I committed culpable homicide` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE

-- 222(3): homicide is culpable or not culpable; homicide that is not culpable is not an offence
