-- not a practitioner: the exemption is for practitioners
#ASSERT `Under section 227(1), have I committed culpable homicide by providing medical assistance in dying` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

