#ASSERT `Under section 227(4), does the rule that no one may consent to death being inflicted on them apply to me when I receive medical assistance in dying` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- not provided in accordance with section 241.2: the subsection says nothing
#ASSERT `Under section 227(4), does the rule that no one may consent to death being inflicted on them apply to me when I receive medical assistance in dying` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- 228: no person commits culpable homicide where he causes the death of a human being by any influence on the mind alone, except where death is caused by wilfully frightening a child or sick person
