-- one year: below the lowest band (two years or more): not covered
#ASSERT `Under section 263.1(3), what is the longest term of imprisonment I am liable to on indictment for violence against an intimate partner` FALSE 1 0 FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

-- 263.1(2)(a): no proceedings shall be commenced by way of indictment if the included offence may be prosecuted only by way of summary conviction proceedings
#ASSERT `Under section 263.1(2), may proceedings against me for violence against an intimate partner be commenced the way they were` `by indictment` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
