§ `Sexual assault, consent and removal of a child from Canada (ss 271 to 273.3)`

-- The plain case.
#ASSERT `Under section 271, am I guilty of the offence of sexual assault` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 271, am I guilty of the offence of sexual assault` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Indictable, adult complainant: not more than 10 years.
#ASSERT `Under section 271, what punishment can I face for sexual assault` `by indictment` 30 EQUALS (Punishment OF `by indictment`, (`imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`)
-- Complainant under 16: not more than 14 years and a minimum of one year.
