§ `Part VIII.1 -- section 320.36 (use of my samples and results)`
#ASSERT `Under section 320.36(1), is the use of my bodily substance prohibited` TRUE TRUE EQUALS (JUST TRUE)   -- use of a substance obtained under this Part for another purpose is prohibited
#ASSERT `Under section 320.36(1), is the use of my bodily substance prohibited` TRUE FALSE EQUALS (JUST FALSE)   -- used for an analysis under this Part
#ASSERT `Under section 320.36(2), is the use or disclosure of the results of my tests prohibited` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (JUST TRUE)   -- use or disclosure for another purpose is prohibited
#ASSERT `Under section 320.36(2), is the use or disclosure of the results of my tests prohibited` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (JUST FALSE)   -- "except for the purpose of the administration or enforcement of a federal or provincial Act"
#ASSERT `Under section 320.36(2), is the use or disclosure of the results of my tests prohibited` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (JUST FALSE)   -- disclosure to the person to whom they relate is permitted by (3)
#ASSERT `Under section 320.36(2), is the use or disclosure of the results of my tests prohibited` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS (JUST TRUE)   -- anonymous but not for statistical or research purposes: subsection (3) gives no permission on these facts, so the prohibition stands (fork F26)
#ASSERT `Under section 320.36(3), may the results of my tests be disclosed` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (JUST TRUE)   -- disclosed to the person to whom they relate
#ASSERT `Under section 320.36(3), may the results of my tests be disclosed` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- anonymous but not for statistical or research purposes: not covered
-- arguments for 320.36(4): the substance was obtained under this Part ; the use is for another purpose ; the results were obtained under this Part ; the person uses or discloses them ; for the administration or enforcement of a federal or provincial Act ; to the person to whom they relate ; made anonymous ; for statistical or research purposes
#ASSERT `Under section 320.36(4), have I committed the offence of contravening subsection 320.36(1) or (2)` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (JUST TRUE)   -- contravenes subsection (1)
#ASSERT `Under section 320.36(4), have I committed the offence of contravening subsection 320.36(1) or (2)` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (JUST TRUE)   -- contravenes subsection (2)
#ASSERT `Under section 320.36(4), have I committed the offence of contravening subsection 320.36(1) or (2)` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (JUST FALSE)   -- contravenes neither
#ASSERT `Under section 320.36(4), have I committed the offence of contravening subsection 320.36(1) or (2)` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS (JUST FALSE)   -- the disclosure to the person to whom the results relate is permitted by (3): no contravention

-- ====================================================================================================
-- cases-seat questions from part ccc12 (merged by the lead on 2026-11-12; unchanged text follows)
