#ASSERT `Under section 380.1(1), must the court consider the circumstance as aggravating` 381 "" `s 380.1(1) the magnitude, complexity, duration or degree of planning of the fraud committed was significant` EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- "where a court imposes a sentence for an offence referred to in section 380, 382, 382.1 or 400": a sentence for a section 381 offence is outside the subsection
-- Under section 380.1(1.1), must the court consider the value of the fraud as aggravating
#ASSERT `Under section 380.1(1.1), must the court consider the value of the fraud as aggravating` 382 "" 2000000 EQUALS JUST TRUE      -- section 382 is named, and the value exceeded one million dollars
