#ASSERT `Under section 380.1(1.1), must the court consider the value of the fraud as aggravating` 380 "" 2000000 EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- "when a court imposes a sentence for an offence referred to in section 382, 382.1 or 400": a "when" gate, read as "where" (Delegated ruling (c) of 2026-11-05, with Periods ruling (b)), so JUST FALSE for section 380
#ASSERT `Under section 380.1(1.1), must the court consider the value of the fraud as aggravating` 382 "" 1000000 EQUALS NOTHING      -- exactly one million does not exceed it: the subsection says nothing about a fraud of that size
