§ `Securities, title and trade secrets, ss 382 to 392`

-- Under section 382, is what I did the offence of fraudulent manipulation of stock exchange transactions, and what are its class and punishments
#ASSERT (`Under section 382, is what I did the offence of fraudulent manipulation of stock exchange transactions, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST TRUE      -- every element met
#ASSERT (`Under section 382, is what I did the offence of fraudulent manipulation of stock exchange transactions, and what are its class and punishments` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- the first element is missing: the person acts through the facility of a stock exchange, curb market or other market
#ASSERT (`Under section 382, is what I did the offence of fraudulent manipulation of stock exchange transactions, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the class of the offence, if it is one` EQUALS JUST `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`      -- the class the penalty provision gives (s 382)
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment by indictment` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 382, is what I did the offence of fraudulent manipulation of stock exchange transactions, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`      -- the greatest term by indictment the penalty provision gives (s 382)
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum fine on summary conviction` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 382, is what I did the offence of fraudulent manipulation of stock exchange transactions, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `a fine of` 5000      -- the summary limb is what the person gave for section 787(1)
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment on summary conviction` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 382, is what I did the offence of fraudulent manipulation of stock exchange transactions, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 24, 0, TRUE)      -- the summary limb is what the person gave for section 787(1): 24 months, less a day
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment on summary conviction` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 382, is what I did the offence of fraudulent manipulation of stock exchange transactions, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE 5000 24 FALSE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 24, 0, FALSE)      -- the same, when the person says the term is not "less a day"
-- Under section 382.1(1), is what I did the offence of buying or selling a security using inside information, and what are its class and punishments
#ASSERT (`Under section 382.1(1), is what I did the offence of buying or selling a security using inside information, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST TRUE      -- every element met
#ASSERT (`Under section 382.1(1), is what I did the offence of buying or selling a security using inside information, and what are its class and punishments` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- the first element is missing: the person directly or indirectly buys or sells a security
#ASSERT (`Under section 382.1(1), is what I did the offence of buying or selling a security using inside information, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the class of the offence, if it is one` EQUALS JUST `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`      -- the class the penalty provision gives (s 382.1(1))
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment by indictment` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 382.1(1), is what I did the offence of buying or selling a security using inside information, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`      -- the greatest term by indictment the penalty provision gives (s 382.1(1))
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum fine on summary conviction` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 382.1(1), is what I did the offence of buying or selling a security using inside information, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `a fine of` 5000      -- the summary limb is what the person gave for section 787(1)
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment on summary conviction` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 382.1(1), is what I did the offence of buying or selling a security using inside information, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 24, 0, TRUE)      -- the summary limb is what the person gave for section 787(1): 24 months, less a day
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment on summary conviction` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 382.1(1), is what I did the offence of buying or selling a security using inside information, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` FALSE 5000 24 FALSE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 24, 0, FALSE)      -- the same, when the person says the term is not "less a day"
-- Under section 382.1(2), is what I did the offence of tipping, and what are its class and punishments
#ASSERT (`Under section 382.1(2), is what I did the offence of tipping, and what are its class and punishments` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` TRUE FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST TRUE      -- every element met
#ASSERT (`Under section 382.1(2), is what I did the offence of tipping, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` TRUE FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- "Except when necessary in the course of business": the text closes the gate in its own words
#ASSERT (`Under section 382.1(2), is what I did the offence of tipping, and what are its class and punishments` FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` TRUE FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- an element of the offence is missing (fork F1)
#ASSERT (`Under section 382.1(2), is what I did the offence of tipping, and what are its class and punishments` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` TRUE TRUE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- section 382.1(3): "an act is not an offence under this section if it is authorized or required, or is not prohibited, by any federal or provincial Act or regulation"
#ASSERT (`Under section 382.1(2), is what I did the offence of tipping, and what are its class and punishments` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) none of the ways in paragraphs (a) to (e)` TRUE FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- the information must be possessed or obtained "in a manner referred to in subsection (1)"
#ASSERT (`Under section 382.1(2), is what I did the offence of tipping, and what are its class and punishments` FALSE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` TRUE FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- section 382.1(4): inside information "has not been generally disclosed"; without that the information is not inside information
#ASSERT (`Under section 382.1(2), is what I did the offence of tipping, and what are its class and punishments` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` TRUE FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the class of the offence, if it is one` EQUALS JUST `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`      -- the class the penalty provision gives (s 382.1(2))
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment by indictment` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 382.1(2), is what I did the offence of tipping, and what are its class and punishments` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` TRUE FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `five years`      -- the greatest term by indictment the penalty provision gives (s 382.1(2))
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum fine on summary conviction` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 382.1(2), is what I did the offence of tipping, and what are its class and punishments` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` TRUE FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `a fine of` 5000      -- the summary limb is what the person gave for section 787(1)
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment on summary conviction` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 382.1(2), is what I did the offence of tipping, and what are its class and punishments` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` TRUE FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 24, 0, TRUE)      -- the summary limb is what the person gave for section 787(1): 24 months, less a day
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment on summary conviction` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 382.1(2), is what I did the offence of tipping, and what are its class and punishments` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 382.1(1) possessed by virtue of being a shareholder of the issuer of that security` TRUE FALSE 5000 24 FALSE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 24, 0, FALSE)      -- the same, when the person says the term is not "less a day"
