#ASSERT (`Under section 383(1), is what I did the offence of gaming in stocks or merchandise, and what are its class and punishments` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- an element of the offence is missing (fork F1)
