#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment on summary conviction` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 394.1(3), am I guilty of an offence for contravening subsection (1), and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE `a mineral` 10000 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 24, 0, TRUE)      -- the summary limb is what the person gave for section 787(1): 24 months, less a day
