#ASSERT `Under section 394.1(4), may the court order the thing forfeited, subject to subsection (5)` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE      -- a thing that is not real property is outside subsection (5); subsection (4) lets the court order anything by means of or in relation to which the offence was committed forfeited
