#ASSERT `Under section 394.1(4), may the court order the thing forfeited, subject to subsection (5)` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE      -- subsection (5) excepts real property "other than" real property built or significantly modified to facilitate the offence, so subsection (4) still applies to it
