#ASSERT `Under section 395(2), what order shall the justice make` FALSE TRUE EQUALS `s 395(2)(b)(i) that it be restored to the owner`      -- paragraph (b)(i): not detained, so restored to the owner (fork F9)
#ASSERT `Under section 395(2), what order shall the justice make` FALSE FALSE EQUALS `s 395(2)(b)(ii) that it be forfeited to Her Majesty in right of the province in which the proceedings take place`      -- paragraph (b)(ii): not detained and the owner cannot be ascertained (fork F9)
