#ASSERT (`Under section 430(3), is what I did the offence of mischief in relation to property of great value, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 430(1) destroys or damages property` TRUE `s 430(6) the person stops work as a result of the failure of their employer and themselves to agree on any matter relating to their employment` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 5000 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- property worth exactly $5,000 is not property "the value of which exceeds five thousand dollars", and it is not a testamentary instrument
#ASSERT (`Under section 430(3), is what I did the offence of mischief in relation to property of great value, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 430(1) destroys or damages property` TRUE `s 430(6) the person stops work as a result of the failure of their employer and themselves to agree on any matter relating to their employment` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE 100 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST TRUE      -- "property that is a testamentary instrument": a will worth $100 is within subsection (3)
#ASSERT (`Under section 430(3), is what I did the offence of mischief in relation to property of great value, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 430(1) destroys or damages property` FALSE `s 430(6) the person stops work as a result of the failure of their employer and themselves to agree on any matter relating to their employment` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 10000 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- section 428: "property means real or personal corporeal property"; a thing that is not property is outside mischief in relation to property
#ASSERT (`Under section 430(3), is what I did the offence of mischief in relation to property of great value, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 430(1) destroys or damages property` TRUE `s 430(6) the person stops work as a result of the failure of their employer and themselves to agree on any matter relating to their employment` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 10000 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the class of the offence, if it is one` EQUALS JUST `an offence that the section makes both indictable and punishable on summary conviction`      -- the class the penalty provision gives (s 430(3))
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment by indictment` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 430(3), is what I did the offence of mischief in relation to property of great value, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 430(1) destroys or damages property` TRUE `s 430(6) the person stops work as a result of the failure of their employer and themselves to agree on any matter relating to their employment` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 10000 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` `ten years`      -- the greatest term by indictment the penalty provision gives (s 430(3))
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum fine on summary conviction` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 430(3), is what I did the offence of mischief in relation to property of great value, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 430(1) destroys or damages property` TRUE `s 430(6) the person stops work as a result of the failure of their employer and themselves to agree on any matter relating to their employment` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 10000 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `a fine of` 5000      -- the summary limb is what the person gave for section 787(1)
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment on summary conviction` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 430(3), is what I did the offence of mischief in relation to property of great value, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 430(1) destroys or damages property` TRUE `s 430(6) the person stops work as a result of the failure of their employer and themselves to agree on any matter relating to their employment` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 10000 5000 24 TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 24, 0, TRUE)      -- the summary limb is what the person gave for section 787(1): 24 months, less a day
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment on summary conviction` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 430(3), is what I did the offence of mischief in relation to property of great value, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE `s 430(1) destroys or damages property` TRUE `s 430(6) the person stops work as a result of the failure of their employer and themselves to agree on any matter relating to their employment` FALSE FALSE FALSE FALSE 10000 5000 24 FALSE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 0, 24, 0, FALSE)      -- the same, when the person says the term is not "less a day"
