§ `Arson and other interference with property, ss 433 to 443`

-- Under section 433, is what I did the offence of arson -- disregard for human life, and what are its class and punishments
#ASSERT (`Under section 433, is what I did the offence of arson -- disregard for human life, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST TRUE      -- every element met
#ASSERT (`Under section 433, is what I did the offence of arson -- disregard for human life, and what are its class and punishments` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 whether what I did is the offence` EQUALS JUST FALSE      -- the first element is missing: the person intentionally or recklessly causes damage by fire or explosion to the property
#ASSERT (`Under section 433, is what I did the offence of arson -- disregard for human life, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the class of the offence, if it is one` EQUALS JUST `an indictable offence`      -- the class the penalty provision gives (s 433)
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the maximum imprisonment by indictment` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 433, is what I did the offence of arson -- disregard for human life, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS `imprisonment for life`      -- the greatest term by indictment the penalty provision gives (s 433)
#ASSERT `ccc13 test the number of limbs` (`ccc13 test the limbs of the answer` ((`Under section 433, is what I did the offence of arson -- disregard for human life, and what are its class and punishments` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE)'s `s 380 to 447.1 the punishments the offence is liable to, if it is one`)) EQUALS 1      -- the penalty provision states one limb (s 433)
