#ASSERT `Under section 459, have I committed the offence of conveying coining instruments out of a mint` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 459, have I committed the offence of conveying coining instruments out of a mint` TRUE FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Under section 459, what punishment can I be given for conveying coining instruments out of a mint` EQUALS LIST (Punishment OF `by indictment`, `imprisonment for a term of` (`Length of time` OF 14, 0, 0, FALSE), `no imprisonment is stated`, `no fine is stated`, `no fine is stated`)
-- An advertisement offering counterfeit money for sale.
