§ `Part XIV -- rules of court and case management (ss 482 and 482.1)`

-- The Court of Appeal for Ontario is a superior court of criminal jurisdiction and a court of appeal: its rules, not inconsistent with an Act, apply to a criminal matter within its jurisdiction.
#ASSERT `Under section 482(1), do the rules of court made by the court that is to hear my case apply to my prosecution, proceeding, action or appeal` `the Court of Appeal` Ontario TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 482(1), do the rules of court made by the court that is to hear my case apply to my prosecution, proceeding, action or appeal` `the Court of Appeal` Ontario FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Under section 482(1), do the rules of court made by the court that is to hear my case apply to my prosecution, proceeding, action or appeal` `the Court of Appeal` Ontario TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The Ontario Court of Justice is neither: section 482(1) does not make rules of its own.
#ASSERT `Under section 482(1), do the rules of court made by the court that is to hear my case apply to my prosecution, proceeding, action or appeal` `the Ontario Court of Justice` Ontario TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- The Provincial Court of Alberta is named in section 482(2)(k).
#ASSERT `Under section 482(2), are the rules of court made by the court that is to hear my case applicable to my prosecution, proceeding, action or appeal` `s 482(2)(k) the Provincial Court of Alberta` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 482(2), are the rules of court made by the court that is to hear my case applicable to my prosecution, proceeding, action or appeal` `s 482(2)(k) the Provincial Court of Alberta` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
-- A court of criminal jurisdiction for a province (paragraph (a)).
#ASSERT `Under section 482(2), are the rules of court made by the court that is to hear my case applicable to my prosecution, proceeding, action or appeal` `s 482(2)(a) a court of criminal jurisdiction for a province` TRUE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- A court no paragraph names: not covered.
#ASSERT `Under section 482(2), are the rules of court made by the court that is to hear my case applicable to my prosecution, proceeding, action or appeal` `s 482(2) another court that no paragraph names` FALSE FALSE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
