#ASSERT `Under section 482(4), have the rules of court been published or otherwise made available to the public as the subsection requires` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Under section 482(4), have the rules of court been published or otherwise made available to the public as the subsection requires` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Uniform rules made by the Governor in Council prevail and have effect as if enacted by the Code.
