#ASSERT `Under section 530.1(b), may I and my counsel use either official language in written pleadings or other documents` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- No order was granted: the paragraph speaks only of an order under section 530, and a grant outside that gate is not covered.

-- section 530.1(c)
