#ASSERT `Under section 530.1(c), may any witness give evidence in either official language during my preliminary inquiry or trial` TRUE `preliminary inquiry` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- The same, at the preliminary inquiry.
#ASSERT `Under section 530.1(c), may any witness give evidence in either official language during my preliminary inquiry or trial` TRUE `sentencing` EQUALS NOTHING   -- At sentencing: the paragraph speaks of the preliminary inquiry or trial.
#ASSERT `Under section 530.1(c), may any witness give evidence in either official language during my preliminary inquiry or trial` FALSE `trial` EQUALS NOTHING   -- No order was granted: the paragraph speaks only of an order under section 530, and a grant outside that gate is not covered.

-- section 530.1(d)
