#ASSERT `Under section 530.1(d), do I have a right to have a justice presiding over my preliminary inquiry who speaks my official language or both official languages` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- No order was granted: "If an order is granted under section 530".

-- section 530.1(e)
