#ASSERT `Under section 530.1(e), do I have a right to have a prosecutor, other than a private prosecutor, who speaks my official language or both official languages` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- No order was granted.
#ASSERT `Under section 530.1(e), do I have a right to have a prosecutor, other than a private prosecutor, who speaks my official language or both official languages` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- The prosecutor is a private prosecutor: "other than a private prosecutor".

-- section 530.1(f)
