#ASSERT `Under section 530.1(f), must the court make interpreters available to assist me, my counsel or any witness during the preliminary inquiry or trial` TRUE `appeal` EQUALS NOTHING   -- On appeal: not covered.
#ASSERT `Under section 530.1(f), must the court make interpreters available to assist me, my counsel or any witness during the preliminary inquiry or trial` FALSE `preliminary inquiry` EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- No order was granted.

