#ASSERT `Under section 530.1(h), must the court make the written trial judgment available in my official language` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- The judgment was given orally only: the paragraph speaks of a judgment "issued in writing".
#ASSERT `Under section 530.1(h), must the court make the written trial judgment available in my official language` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- No order was granted.

