#ASSERT `Under section 536(2.1), must the justice put me to an election in the words of subsection (2.1)` `an indictable offence` `by indictment` FALSE 10 TRUE 267 "" `s 553(a) an offence that paragraph (a) does not name` FALSE FALSE 0 `s 553(b) with the offence itself` FALSE `s 536(1) a justice other than a provincial court judge` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- Listed in section 469 and under 14 years: excluded by the subsection.
