-- ====================================================================================================
-- cases-seat questions from part ccc25 (merged by the lead on 2026-11-12; unchanged text follows)
-- ====================================================================================================
-- ccc25-cases-seat.l4 -- cases for the seat questions of ccc25-seat.l4: the facts a person accused of an offence would state, and the answer the text of Part XXII.1 or XXII.2 gives.
-- Every expected value is written by hand from the text, with the words that decide it. At least one case per question; a case outside the encoding (an explicit NOTHING) wherever the question has one.

§ `Part XXII.1 Remediation Agreements`
#ASSERT `Under section 715.3(1), is my body an organization for the purposes of Part XXII.1 (remediation agreements)` `a body corporate` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- a body corporate is an organization within section 2 and is none of the three excluded kinds
#ASSERT `Under section 715.3(1), is my body an organization for the purposes of Part XXII.1 (remediation agreements)` `an association of persons` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- an association of persons with a common purpose, an operational structure and a public face is an organization (section 2(b))
#ASSERT `Under section 715.3(1), is my body an organization for the purposes of Part XXII.1 (remediation agreements)` `a public body` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE   -- 715.3(1): the definition does not include a public body
