-- ccc27-cases-seat.l4 -- cases for the seat layer: the facts a person in the seat would state, and the answer the text gives. Every expected value is written
-- from the text of the section, beside the case; each case calls the seat question by its name. Assertions written equal assertions satisfied.

§ `Seat cases -- sections 737 to 751.1`

#ASSERT `Under section 737(1), must I pay a victim surcharge` TRUE FALSE `s 737(1) this Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- convicted of an offence under this Act
#ASSERT `Under section 737(1), must I pay a victim surcharge` FALSE TRUE `s 737(1) the Cannabis Act` EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- discharged under section 730, Cannabis Act
#ASSERT `Under section 737(1), must I pay a victim surcharge` TRUE FALSE `s 737(1) some other Act` EQUALS NOTHING   -- not one of the three Acts
#ASSERT `Under section 737(2), how much is the victim surcharge, in dollars` TRUE 1000 TRUE EQUALS JUST 300   -- 30% of a $1000 fine
#ASSERT `Under section 737(2), how much is the victim surcharge, in dollars` FALSE 0 FALSE EQUALS JUST 100   -- no fine, summary conviction
#ASSERT `Under section 737(2), how much is the victim surcharge, in dollars` FALSE 0 TRUE EQUALS JUST 200   -- no fine, indictment
#ASSERT `Under section 737(2.1), may the court order me to pay no victim surcharge, or a reduced amount` TRUE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (a) undue hardship
#ASSERT `Under section 737(2.1), may the court order me to pay no victim surcharge, or a reduced amount` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE   -- (2.3): imprisonment alone is not undue hardship, so (b): no hardship but disproportionate
#ASSERT `Under section 737(2.1), may the court order me to pay no victim surcharge, or a reduced amount` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- no hardship and not disproportionate: not covered (F-2)
#ASSERT `Under section 737(2.1), may the court order me to pay no victim surcharge, or a reduced amount` FALSE TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- offence before the day: subsection (8)
#ASSERT `Under section 737(3), may the court order a victim surcharge above the amount in subsection (2)` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 737(3), may the court order a victim surcharge above the amount in subsection (2)` TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING   -- not satisfied the offender can pay
