#ASSERT `Under section 830(2), is the appeal required to be based on a transcript of the proceedings appealed from` TRUE 16 TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Under section 830(2), is the appeal required to be based on a transcript of the proceedings appealed from` TRUE 10 FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE

-- s 830(3) the notice of appeal is served and filed within thirty days after the date of the decision
